# Coalstoke Gearhulk takes any graveyard, not only its controller's: Bot2's Entomb puts a Hill Giant in Bot2's graveyard and
# Bot1's Gearhulk puts it onto the battlefield under Bot1's control, where it attacks Bot2 with haste and is exiled at the
# beginning of Bot1's next end step (Hill Giant's owner is Bot2).

